# Netlify _redirects (site publish root)
# 1) Old netlify.app address -> real domain (fixes duplicate-content / wrong canonical problem)
https://design-haus-studio.netlify.app/*   https://designhauss.com/:splat   301!

# 2) www -> non-www
https://www.designhauss.com/*   https://designhauss.com/:splat   301!

# 3) Project details redirect to clean static project pages
/project-details id=:id   /projects/:id   301!
/project-details          /projects       301!
/project-details.html     /projects       301!

# 4) Old .html URLs -> clean URLs
/index.html     /          301!
/studio.html    /studio    301!
/services.html  /services  301!
/projects.html  /projects  301!
/contact.html   /contact   301!
